  CellName: Hedgerow
  Description: 'Bocage - intensity 2 of Hedgerow: twelve hedges farther out, and every rival''s wall
    eating too. The standard 1200 u cell with its nucleus (~392 u), no environment, no flora
    and no fauna. The field (12 hedges of 32 x 2 bricks, 768 prisms in all, 821 u out) is
    laid by HedgerowController. 3 omni crystals respawn inside the nucleus (the scene''s
    CrystalManager). Frenzy sits 25% above the full arena (11,568 prisms, 832,896 volume).
    Authored by Tools/Build/author_hedgerow_assets.py - re-run it rather than hand-editing.'
